<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-stone-800 mt-12 mb-4 leading-snug font-display border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 inline-block">Why Families Love 4BHK Villas in Lonavala</h2>

<p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-5">A 4BHK villa offers four separate bedrooms, which means grandparents, parents, teenagers, and young kids all have their own space. The shared living areas, dining halls, and outdoor spaces become the heart of the family vacation — a place for bonding, playing, and relaxing together.</p>

